{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>inBox - courier simulator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where the alarm screams at 4 AM and your best friend is a can of cheap energy drink. Jump into your beat-up delivery van and try to survive a workday that never goes according to plan.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily struggle for survival</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleepy mornings, broken elevators and the first stairs to climb.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stats like hunger, fatigue or physiological needs \u2013 ignore them and your day will end quickly.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy drinks, hot dogs and fizzy sodas are your main diet.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your van \u2013 your fortress</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start up the rattling diesel and drive wherever the GPS tells you.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loading parcels is a separate mini-game \u2013 it never goes as smoothly as it should.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stickers, skins and other useful upgrades.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliver packages, discover villages</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Country roads, potholes and shabby towns with absurd names.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers who can be more problematic than the parcels themselves.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The further you go, the stranger things you\u2019ll encounter.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life on the edge</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay your bills, refuel the van and keep yourself afloat.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day is a balance between making money and crashing your car into a ditch.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The community awaits your memes \u2013 because this game is as serious as its title.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>inBox</strong> is a game about hard work, light humor and everyday absurdity.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you survive as a courier?  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966910?t=1761502239","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966910?t=1761502239","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966910/cf5eb64d3c112f0d237328497e27a0e08d3c8964/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761502239","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966910/cf5eb64d3c112f0d237328497e27a0e08d3c8964/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761502239","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>inBox - courier simulator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where the alarm screams at 4 AM and your best friend is a can of cheap energy drink. Jump into your beat-up delivery van and try to survive a workday that never goes according to plan.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003\u2003</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily struggle for survival</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleepy mornings, broken elevators and the first stairs to climb.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stats like hunger, fatigue or physiological needs \u2013 ignore them and your day will e